DTSTAMP:20261104T150946Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261029
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261030
SUMMARY:Deadline: Fondation Vocatio: Bourse Vocatio 2027 (EUR 10\,000 for y
 oung talents in Belgium)
DESCRIPTION:Annual vocation bursaries for young talents in six fields inclu
 ding arts plastiques\, arts de la scene and sciences et techniques\; digit
 al and media artists apply under arts plastiques or sciences et techniques
 . The EUR 10\,000 bourse funds a concrete personal project: equipment\, pr
 oduction or training.\n\nOrganisation: Fondation Vocatio\nLocation: Brusse
 ls\, Belgium. RESTRICTED: Belgian nationals\, or persons domiciled in Belg
 ium and resident there for at least 5 years\; aged over 18 and under 35 on
  31 December of the application year.\nAward: EUR 10\,000 bourse per laure
 ate\, funding a concrete personal project (equipment\, production\, traini
 ng). No application fee.\nDuration: Per project\n\nMore: https://www.vocat
 io.be/fr/pose-ta-candidature?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
 ium=referral
URL:https://www.vocatio.be/fr/pose-ta-candidature?utm_source=artificialnouv
 eaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Brussels\, Belgium. RESTRICTED: Belgian nationals\, or persons dom
 iciled in Belgium and resident there for at least 5 years\; aged over 18 a
 nd under 35 on 31 December of the application year.
END:VEVENT
