DTSTAMP:20261104T150946Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261110
SUMMARY:Deadline: Kunststiftung Sachsen-Anhalt: Arbeitsstipendien and Proje
 ktfoerderung (round 2/2026)
DESCRIPTION:The Sachsen-Anhalt state art foundation's twice-yearly round: w
 ork stipends for free artistic development (EUR 1\,500 per month for 3 or 
 6 months\, no output obligation) and project funding for artistic projects
  including publications\, across all disciplines including media art. ELIG
 IBILITY (strict): freelance artists with primary residence in Sachsen-Anha
 lt.\n\nOrganisation: Kunststiftung des Landes Sachsen-Anhalt\nLocation: Ha
 lle (Saale)\, Germany. RESTRICTED: freelance artists with primary residenc
 e in Sachsen-Anhalt.\nAward: Arbeitsstipendium: EUR 1\,500 per month for 3
  or 6 months. Projektfoerderung: amounts per project budget. No applicatio
 n fee.\nDuration: 3 or 6 months\n\nMore: https://www.kunststiftung-sachsen
 -anhalt.de/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.kunststiftung-sachsen-anhalt.de/?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Halle (Saale)\, Germany. RESTRICTED: freelance artists with primar
 y residence in Sachsen-Anhalt.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
