DTSTAMP:20261104T150946Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261215
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261216
SUMMARY:Deadline: Auslandsstipendien von Bund und Laendern 2028 (Villa Mass
 imo\, Casa Baldi\, Venice\, Paris)
DESCRIPTION:Germany's flagship residency awards for visual artists\, archit
 ects\, writers and composers\, administered by the Kulturstiftung der Laen
 der for the federal government.\n\nOrganisation: Kulturstiftung der Laende
 r / BKM (German federal and state governments)\nLocation: Residencies in R
 ome (Villa Massimo\, 10 months)\, Olevano Romano (Casa Baldi\, 3 months)\,
  Venice (Deutsches Studienzentrum\, 3 months) and Paris (6 months). RESTRI
 CTED: German citizenship OR primary residence and artistic practice in Ger
 many.\nAward: Villa Massimo: EUR 3\,000/month\; Casa Baldi: EUR 3\,000/mon
 th\; Deutsches Studienzentrum Venedig: EUR 1\,534/month\; Paris: approx. E
 UR 1\,500/month. Accommodation and studio provided at all locations. No ap
 plication fee.\nDuration: 3 to 10 months depending on residency\n\nMore: h
 ttps://www.kulturstiftung.de/auslandsstipendien-von-bund-und-laendern-allg
 emeines/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.kulturstiftung.de/auslandsstipendien-von-bund-und-laendern-
 allgemeines/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Residencies in Rome (Villa Massimo\, 10 months)\, Olevano Romano (
 Casa Baldi\, 3 months)\, Venice (Deutsches Studienzentrum\, 3 months) and 
 Paris (6 months). RESTRICTED: German citizenship OR primary residence and 
 artistic practice in Germany.
END:VEVENT
