BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kunstendecreet-beurzen-2027-maart@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T150946Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270315
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270316
SUMMARY:Deadline: Flemish Government: Kunstendecreet beurzen voor kunstenaa
 rs (March 2027 round)
DESCRIPTION:Development bursaries for individual professional artists under
  the Flemish Arts Decree: free development time with no output obligation\
 , across all disciplines of the professional arts including media/digital 
 art and sound. Two strands: opkomend talent (EUR 7\,500\, one year) and be
 wezen talent (EUR 12\,000 per year for one\, two or three years).\n\nOrgan
 isation: Flemish Government\, Department of Culture\, Youth and Media (Kun
 stendecreet)\nLocation: Flanders and Brussels\, Belgium. RESTRICTED: indiv
 idual professional artists connected to the Flemish Community (living and/
 or working in Flanders or Brussels).\nAward: Beurs opkomend talent (emergi
 ng talent): EUR 7\,500 lump sum for 1 year. Beurs bewezen talent (proven t
